  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 531.02 Recipient Eligibility. All medicaid recipients shall be eligible for physician services in accordance with He-W 531.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #6051, eff 6-17-95; ss by #7895, eff 5-21-03; ss by #9915, INTERIM, eff 5-15-11, EXPIRES: 11-14-11; ss by #10018, eff 11-14-11; ss by #12999, eff 3-5-20",
